# op4
===
 Op4 is a terminal-based encrypted messaging application written in Rust. It provides end-to-end encrypted private messaging with post-quantum cryptography, routed entirely through the Tor anonymity network so that neither the content of your messages nor your IP address is exposed to anyone — not even the person you are talking to.
